Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_bikeshare.bikeshare_station_status
Column name: station_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier of a station
Column name: num_bikes_available Type: INT64 Description: Number of bikes available for rental
Column name: num_bikes_disabled Type: INT64 Description: Number of disabled bikes at the station. Vendors who do not want to publicize the number of disabled bikes or docks in their system can opt to omit station capacity (in station_information), num_bikes_disabled and num_docks_disabled. If station capacity is published then broken docks/bikes can be inferred (though not specifically whether the decreased capacity is a broken bike or dock)
Column name: num_docks_available Type: INT64 Description: Number of docks accepting bike returns
Column name: num_docks_disabled Type: INT64 Description: Number of empty but disabled dock points at the station. This value remains as part of the spec as it is possibly useful during development
Column name: is_installed Type: BOOL Description: 1/0 boolean - is the station currently on the street
Column name: is_renting Type: BOOL Description: 1/0 boolean - is the station currently renting bikes (even if the station is empty, if it is set to allow rentals this value should be 1)
Column name: is_returning Type: BOOL Description: 1/0 boolean - is the station accepting bike returns (if a station is full but would allow a return if it was not full then this value should be 1)
Column name: last_reported Type: INT64 Description: Integer POSIX timestamp indicating the last time this station reported its status to the backend
Column name: num_ebikes_available Type: INT64
Column name: eightd_has_available_keys Type: BOOL
Sample rows:
[{'station_id': '154e0ab8-c249-42a9-aa0f-ed766aa7bfb5', 'num_bikes_available': 0, 'num_bikes_disabled': 0, 'num_docks_available': 0, 'num_docks_disabled': 0, 'is_installed': False, 'is_renting': False, 'is_returning': False, 'last_reported': 1724285144, 'num_ebikes_available': 0, 'eightd_has_available_keys': False}, {'station_id': '50518b51-6910-4f71-bb20-7b0d0fc4f4b7', 'num_bikes_available': 15, 'num_bikes_disabled': 0, 'num_docks_available': 0, 'num_docks_disabled': 0, 'is_installed': True, 'is_renting': True, 'is_returning': True, 'last_reported': 1724285071, 'num_ebikes_available': 2, 'eightd_has_available_keys': False}, {'station_id': 'e01b3ae0-0543-484f-9085-bff4af3c174c', 'num_bikes_available': 16, 'num_bikes_disabled': 3, 'num_docks_available': 0, 'num_docks_disabled': 0, 'is_installed': True, 'is_renting': True, 'is_returning': True, 'last_reported': 1724285077, 'num_ebikes_available': 3, 'eightd_has_available_keys': False}, {'station_id': '92045ce2-112c-4cd9-ae42-39aac4f43e86', 'num_bikes_available': 19, 'num_bikes_disabled': 0, 'num_docks_available': 0, 'num_docks_disabled': 0, 'is_installed': True, 'is_renting': True, 'is_returning': True, 'last_reported': 1724285138, 'num_ebikes_available': 9, 'eightd_has_available_keys': False}, {'station_id': 'aa6d4372-55f7-451a-a9ab-a546001fd8f7', 'num_bikes_available': 19, 'num_bikes_disabled': 0, 'num_docks_available': 0, 'num_docks_disabled': 0, 'is_installed': True, 'is_renting': True, 'is_returning': True, 'last_reported': 1724285139, 'num_ebikes_available': 4, 'eightd_has_available_keys': False}]

