Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_transit_muni.shapes
Column name: shape_id Type: STRING Description: Uniquely identifies each shape
Column name: shape_point_sequence Type: INT64 Description: Associates the latitude and longitude of a shape point with its sequence order along the shape. The values for shape_pt_sequence must increase throughout the trip but don't need to be consecutive.
Column name: shape_point_lat Type: FLOAT64 Description: Associates a shape point's latitude with a shape ID.
Column name: shape_point_lon Type: FLOAT64 Description: Associates a shape point's longitude with a shape ID.
Column name: shape_point_geom Type: GEOGRAPHY Description: Geographic representation of the points latitude and longitude
Column name: shape_distance_traveled Type: FLOAT64 Description: Provides the actual distance traveled along the shape from the first shape point to the point specified in this record. This information allows the trip planner to determine how much of the shape to draw when they show part of a trip on the map. The values used for shape_dist_traveled must increase along with shape_pt_sequence: they can't be used to show reverse travel along a route.
Sample rows:
[{'shape_id': '173975', 'shape_point_sequence': 197, 'shape_point_lat': 37.715079, 'shape_point_lon': -122.424956, 'shape_point_geom': 'POINT(-122.424956 37.715079)', 'shape_distance_traveled': 14437.0}, {'shape_id': '173976', 'shape_point_sequence': 195, 'shape_point_lat': 37.715079, 'shape_point_lon': -122.424956, 'shape_point_geom': 'POINT(-122.424956 37.715079)', 'shape_distance_traveled': 14391.0}, {'shape_id': '174183', 'shape_point_sequence': 283, 'shape_point_lat': 37.832971, 'shape_point_lon': -122.538276, 'shape_point_geom': 'POINT(-122.538276 37.832971)', 'shape_distance_traveled': 21512.0}, {'shape_id': '174271', 'shape_point_sequence': 92, 'shape_point_lat': 37.760837, 'shape_point_lon': -122.440596, 'shape_point_geom': 'POINT(-122.440596 37.760837)', 'shape_distance_traveled': 5348.0}, {'shape_id': '174272', 'shape_point_sequence': 185, 'shape_point_lat': 37.760837, 'shape_point_lon': -122.440596, 'shape_point_geom': 'POINT(-122.440596 37.760837)', 'shape_distance_traveled': 6161.0}]

