Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_transit_muni.trips
Column name: trip_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier for each trip
Column name: route_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier for each route. A single route will have multiple trips
Column name: direction Type: STRING Description: "Indicates the direction of travel for a trip. The following values are valid:   -  O: Outbound travel -  I: Inbound travel  This field is not used in routing, but instead provides a way to separate trips by direction"
Column name: block_id Type: STRING Description: Identifies the block to which the trip belongs. A block consists of a single trip or many sequential trips made with the same vehicle. The trips are grouped into a block by the use of a shared service day andblock_id. A block_id can include trips with different service days, which then makes distinct blocks. For more details, see: https://developers.google.com/transit/gtfs/reference/#example-showing-blocks-and-service-day
Column name: service_category Type: STRING Description: Indicates the type of service for this trip
Column name: trip_headsign Type: STRING Description: Contains the text that appears on signage that identifies the trip's destination to riders. Use this field to distinguish between different patterns of service on the same route.
Column name: shape_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier for the geospatial shape that describes the vehicle travel for a trip along individual points. Use to JOIN with the shapes available in the shapes table
Column name: trip_shape Type: GEOGRAPHY Description: Geographical representation of the trip's entire route.
Sample rows:
[{'trip_id': '8999876', 'route_id': '83X', 'direction': 'O', 'block_id': '8301', 'service_category': None, 'trip_headsign': 'Caltrain Depot', 'shape_id': '174188', 'trip_shape': None}, {'trip_id': '8999873', 'route_id': '83X', 'direction': 'O', 'block_id': '8302', 'service_category': None, 'trip_headsign': 'Caltrain Depot', 'shape_id': '174188', 'trip_shape': None}, {'trip_id': '8999875', 'route_id': '83X', 'direction': 'O', 'block_id': '8301', 'service_category': None, 'trip_headsign': 'Caltrain Depot', 'shape_id': '174188', 'trip_shape': None}, {'trip_id': '8999872', 'route_id': '83X', 'direction': 'O', 'block_id': '8302', 'service_category': None, 'trip_headsign': 'Caltrain Depot', 'shape_id': '174188', 'trip_shape': None}, {'trip_id': '8999892', 'route_id': '83X', 'direction': 'O', 'block_id': '8301', 'service_category': None, 'trip_headsign': 'Caltrain Depot', 'shape_id': '174188', 'trip_shape': None}]

