Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_transit_muni.stop_times
Column name: stop_id Type: INT64 Description: Identifies the serviced stop. Multiple routes can use the same stop.
Column name: trip_id Type: INT64 Description: Identifies a trip. Multiple trips can have the same stop
Column name: stop_sequence Type: INT64 Description: Identifies the order of the stops for a particular trip. The values for stop_sequence must increase throughout the trip but do not need to be consecutive.
Column name: arrival_time Type: TIME Description: Specifies the scheduled arrival time at a specific stop for a specific trip on a route.
Column name: arrives_next_day Type: BOOL Description: Several routes begin before midnight, with service continuing throughout the night. This variable specifies whether arrival_time occurs after midnight the day after the scheduled day.  This is useful for identifying routes that begin one day and end the next day
Column name: departure_time Type: TIME Description: Specifies the scheduled departure time at a specific stop for a specific trip on a route.
Column name: departs_next_day Type: BOOL Description: Several routes begin before midnight, with service continuing throughout the night. This variable specifies whether departure_time occurs after midnight the day after the scheduled day.  This is useful for identifying routes that begin one day and end the next day
Column name: dropoff_type Type: STRING Description: "Indicates whether riders are dropped off at a stop as part of the normal schedule or whether a drop off at the stop isn't available. Available options:  -  regular -  none -  phone (indicates must phone agency to arrange drop off) -  driver (indicates must coordinate with driver to arrange drop off)"
Column name: exact_timepoint Type: BOOL Description: Indicates if the specified arrival and departure times for a stop are strictly adhered to by the transit vehicle, or if they're instead approximate or interpolated times.
Sample rows:
[{'stop_id': 15759, 'trip_id': 8951406, 'stop_sequence': 51, 'arrival_time': '06:54:55', 'arrives_next_day': False, 'departure_time': '06:54:55', 'departs_next_day': False, 'dropoff_type': 'regular', 'exact_timepoint': False}, {'stop_id': 15761, 'trip_id': 8951406, 'stop_sequence': 52, 'arrival_time': '06:55:33', 'arrives_next_day': False, 'departure_time': '06:55:33', 'departs_next_day': False, 'dropoff_type': 'regular', 'exact_timepoint': False}, {'stop_id': 15763, 'trip_id': 8951406, 'stop_sequence': 53, 'arrival_time': '06:56:04', 'arrives_next_day': False, 'departure_time': '06:56:04', 'departs_next_day': False, 'dropoff_type': 'regular', 'exact_timepoint': False}, {'stop_id': 15828, 'trip_id': 8951406, 'stop_sequence': 54, 'arrival_time': '06:57:00', 'arrives_next_day': False, 'departure_time': '06:57:00', 'departs_next_day': False, 'dropoff_type': 'regular', 'exact_timepoint': True}, {'stop_id': 15759, 'trip_id': 8951253, 'stop_sequence': 51, 'arrival_time': '06:54:55', 'arrives_next_day': False, 'departure_time': '06:54:55', 'departs_next_day': False, 'dropoff_type': 'regular', 'exact_timepoint': False}]

