Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_trees.street_trees
Column name: tree_id Type: INT64 Description: Unique ID for Tree
Column name: legal_status Type: STRING Description: Legal staus: Permitted or DPW maintained
Column name: species Type: STRING Description: Species of tree
Column name: address Type: STRING Description: Address of Tree
Column name: site_order Type: INT64 Description: Order of tree at address where multiple trees are at same address. Trees are ordered in ascending address order
Column name: site_info Type: STRING Description: Description of location of tree
Column name: plant_type Type: STRING Description: Landscaping or Tree
Column name: care_taker Type: STRING Description: Agency or person that is primary caregiver to tree. Owner of Tree
Column name: care_assistant Type: STRING Description: Agency or person that is secondary caregiver to tree
Column name: plant_date Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Date tree was planted
Column name: dbh Type: STRING Description: depth height
Column name: plot_size Type: STRING Description: dimension of tree plot
Column name: permit_notes Type: STRING Description: Tree permit number reference
Column name: x_coordinate Type: FLOAT64 Description: CA State Plane III
Column name: y_coordinate Type: FLOAT64 Description: CA State Plane III
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: WGS84
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: WGS84
Column name: location Type: STRING Description: Location formatted for mapping
